  // that finally makes FeatureFlagsController's/SaasBillingController's
  // superadmin routes reachable at all. These were already referenced in
  // @Roles() decorators (feature-flags.controller.ts) before this PR --
  // aspirational, since no real User could ever hold them -- confirmed
  // via schema-wide grep during the SA-1 Phase 1 audit. Adding them
