// PR-4: why this License row exists / was regenerated. LicenseHistory
// stores which reason produced each snapshot. Deliberately includes a
// couple of reasons not yet wired to any producer (PLAN_CHANGED, RENEWAL,
// OVERRIDE_APPLIED, MANUAL_ADMIN) -- reserving enum values now is cheap;
// this is the same reasoning as reserving GRACE_PERIOD/SUSPENDED above.
// Only ONBOARDING_TRIAL and SUBSCRIPTION_ACTIVATED are actually produced
// as of PR-4.
